    "text": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/hhhhhhhhh.JPG\" style=\"width: 147px; height: 150px;\" /><br /><br />We can assume that reflected wave is due to image of <math> <mtext>B</mtext> </math> coming with same speed in opposite direction<br /><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/ci/image52-cbfb2b99-3ffc-42d5-a77c-3ac1c63cb864.jpg\" /><br /><br />Observer<br /><br /><math><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><br /><math><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>320</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>320</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>8000</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>330</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>310</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>8000</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>33</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>31</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>8000</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>8516</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>z</mi></math>",
